  "annotation": {
    "schema_version": 5,
    "type": "new architecture support",
    "problem": [
      {
        "text": "The parent registry does not recognize MiMoForCausalLM, so Config.from_directory rejects that architecture before model construction.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_b667d5bae8644f8ba3f6ecf32e2f1d41",
          "call_b3545801d07748f39d651248f60b35c2"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "reasoning": [
      {
        "text": "The change adds a thin Llama-derived adapter and registers it. Reusing the existing construction avoids a separate implementation of the ordinary decoder; the explicit tradeoff is leaving MTP layers unused.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_6b902011e50c414bbb17d791f7d8422c",
          "call_203f91f3039048fe92c63e666da90779",
          "call_9f5c3e14b0b54f838838d38f1c6f18ab"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "impact": [
      {
        "text": "Directory dispatch can now select MiMoConfig, whose text component constructs MiMoModel. This establishes the configuration and construction route, not measured inference correctness.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_6b902011e50c414bbb17d791f7d8422c",
          "call_203f91f3039048fe92c63e666da90779",
          "call_b3545801d07748f39d651248f60b35c2",
          "call_df72981899454a42a70a58309d074416"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "source_notes": [
      {
        "text": "The introducing models chapter and the architecture-metadata and component-selection entries were read. They establish the inherited Llama mapping, class-owned registration metadata and named-component interface.",
        "basis": "ancestor",
        "evidence": [
          "call_5a54f14a59b345d5a82098a21d2e5501",
          "call_dece70ee28214da993753b8c734ea43e",
          "call_cb23e22b5d97455497aad466fdf96027"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The metadata entry's undefined expect_arch diagnostic is no longer present in the inspected parent: Config.__init__ formats self.arch_string instead. The MiMo diff does not change that corrected code.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_b3545801d07748f39d651248f60b35c2",
          "call_6b902011e50c414bbb17d791f7d8422c",
          "call_203f91f3039048fe92c63e666da90779"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Discussion overlap is inferred from inspected paths, not an upstream link to this change. PR #4, \u201cchore: update config.py,\u201d proposes a spelling correction. Issue #7, \u201cquantizing model: undefined symbol: __cxa_call_terminate,\u201d reports extension loading and an environment workaround. Issue #33, \u201cError converting model,\u201d tracks file-opening failure and later GLM4 generation trouble. Issues #34 and #42 report quantization factorization failures; PR #26, \u201cSuperior 3INST parameters,\u201d concerns codebook parameters. None supplies MiMo-specific validation.",
        "basis": "inference",
        "evidence": [
          "call_6d7a7f56e4a0408985f7afbfab579c74",
